    # bai "That was fun, man. Always enjoy hanging out with you."
    bai "È stato divertente, amico. Mi piace sempre passare del tempo con te."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:50
translate italian baienddate_7cc90c84:

    # bai "Let's do it again sometime."
    bai "Rifacciamolo qualche volta."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:51
translate italian baienddate_8e54c50f:

    # pc "Sure, sounds good."
    pc "Certo, mi sembra una buona idea."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:53
translate italian baienddate_929ef120:

    # bai "Alright man, see you around."
    bai "Va bene, amico, ci vediamo in giro."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:56
translate italian baienddate_e70e2ced:

    # "We get into our separate cars and drive away."
    "Saliamo sulle nostre auto separate e ce ne andiamo."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:64
translate italian baienddate_4a11d772:

    # bai "Thanks for taking me out, [pcname]."
    bai "Grazie per avermi portato fuori, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:65
translate italian baienddate_17764b2d:

    # bai "I had a really good time. I'm looking forward to our next date."
    bai "Mi sono divertita davvero tanto. Non vedo l’ora che arrivi il nostro prossimo appuntamento."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:66
translate italian baienddate_03eaad50:

    # pc "Me too."
    pc "Anch’io."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:68
translate italian baienddate_4924fbc9:

    # "He stands close to me, looking in my eyes expectantly. Thinking about something, but seemingly too afraid to do it."
    "Si avvicina a me, guardandomi negli occhi con aria trepidante. Sta pensando a qualcosa, ma sembra troppo timido per farlo."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:72
translate italian baienddate_18491609:

    # "He looks a bit surprised as I lean in, but quickly accepts it and kisses back."
    "Sembra un po’ sorpreso quando mi avvicino, ma accetta subito e ricambia il bacio."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:74
translate italian baienddate_ea54ee7b:

    # pc "Can I kiss you?"
    pc "Posso baciarti?"

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:75
translate italian baienddate_e48f765e:

    # bai "Yes. I'd like that."
    bai "Sì. Mi piacerebbe."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:77
translate italian baienddate_ceee6fe3:

    # "I lean in and kiss him."
    "Mi avvicino e lo bacio."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:79
translate italian baienddate_30410416:

    # "He looks nervous, then that changes a bit to disappointment."
    "Sembra nervoso, poi la sua espressione si trasforma leggermente in delusione."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:81
translate italian baienddate_17fc970f:

    # "The kiss starts off nervously, but then it changes to something more comfortable and eager."
    "Il bacio inizia in modo un po’ nervoso, ma poi diventa più disinvolto e appassionato."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:82
translate italian baienddate_54e89b78:

    # "And then finally, we pull away."
    "E poi, finalmente, ci stacchiamo."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:84
translate italian baienddate_a5573473:

    # bai "Wow."
    bai "Wow."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:85
translate italian baienddate_d908c8e3:

    # bai "My first kiss with a guy."
    bai "Il mio primo bacio con un ragazzo."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:86
translate italian baienddate_46fbc1b5:

    # pc "How was it?"
    pc "Com’è stato?"

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:87
translate italian baienddate_58dc2fa3:

    # bai "Weird at first. But then it felt good. Incredible even."
    bai "Strano all’inizio. Ma poi è stato bello. Anzi, incredibile."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:88
translate italian baienddate_2b2f5c98:

    # bai "I want more. Hopefully very soon."
    bai "Ne voglio ancora. Spero molto presto."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:89
translate italian baienddate_badd9121:

    # bai "Thanks, [pcname]."
    bai "Grazie, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:96
translate italian baienddate_ba7536f7:

    # "We kiss goodbye. I think both of us want a little more, but it seems now is not the time."
    "Ci diamo un bacio d’addio. Penso che entrambi vorremmo un po’ di più, ma sembra che ora non sia il momento giusto."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:99
translate italian baienddate_fa52edbc:

    # bai "Do you want to maybe come back to my place and uh... do stuff?"
    bai "Ti va magari di venire a casa mia e, ehm... fare qualcosa?"

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:102
translate italian baienddate_c23a8a8d:

    # bai "Awesome."
    bai "Fantastico."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:105
translate italian baienddate_b8b44fef:

    # "We drive back to his apartment, eager to get inside and alone with each other."
    "Torniamo in macchina al suo appartamento, impazienti di entrare e di stare da soli insieme."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:108
translate italian baienddate_c23a8a8d_1:

    # bai "Awesome."
    bai "Fantastico."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:111
translate italian baienddate_b8b44fef_1:

    # "We drive back to his apartment, eager to get inside and alone with each other."
    "Torniamo in macchina al suo appartamento, impazienti di entrare e di stare da soli insieme."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:114
translate italian baienddate_e0fdd0c6:

    # bai "Oh okay, no problem."
    bai "Oh ok, nessun problema."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:116
translate italian baienddate_97513745:

    # bai "Thanks for the nice date then."
    bai "Grazie per la bella serata, allora."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:119
translate italian baidateleave_16a201c5:

    # bai "I'm going to head home. I'll see you later, [pcname]."
    bai "Io vado a casa. Ci vediamo più tardi, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:120
translate italian baidateleave_dc9e5e99:

    # "Bai gets into his car and drives off."
    "Bai sale in macchina e se ne va."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:121
translate italian baidateleave_a9d8a21a:

    # "The date went pretty well, but I think both of us were still a little nervous exploring this new territory."
    "L’appuntamento è andato piuttosto bene, ma credo che entrambi fossimo ancora un po’ nervosi nell’esplorare questo nuovo territorio."

# game/Scenes/Bai/BaiDates/baidate.rpy:122
translate italian baidateleave_07771937:

    # "Hopefully after a couple more dates, we'll get more comfortable with each other and our relationship."
    "Speriamo che dopo un altro paio di appuntamenti ci sentiremo più a nostro agio l’uno con l’altro e con la nostra relazione."

